{
    "_comment": [
        "NWS P-VTEC phenomenon.significance -> SAME event code, per NWS Directive 10-1701",
        "and the SAME event code list in same-us.json. Used by the Encoder's AWIPS/VTEC",
        "import to pick an event code from a pasted product.",
        "",
        "Only pairs that have a SAME code appear here. Several VTEC phenomena are broadcast",
        "under a more general SAME code (heat and cold advisories, air quality, and the",
        "lower-tier marine hazards have no code of their own), so those are absent on",
        "purpose rather than mapped to something approximate.",
        "",
        "A significance of S is a follow-up statement on an existing event; NWS carries those",
        "on the statement codes (SVS/FFS/FLS/HLS) rather than the warning code."
    ],
